title: "Claude Code Agent Team Guide"
abstract: "A guide to running a team of Claude Code subagents: when to delegate, how subagents run, handoff contracts, parallel work in git worktrees, independent verification and failure modes, with eight installable subagents that pin Claude Fable 5.2, Opus 5.5, Sonnet 5.5 or Haiku 5.5 and an effort level to each role."
